{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_07",
  "title": "Relic of Eternal Splendor",
  "storyCode": "SS-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0c0650e7606bb4158ee3ee1bb50680eb029e56e5d0f62a886b4d505a67281f2b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mother, would you mind waiting a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Girls, are you alright?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nngh... I'm okay. Butt hurts a little, but I'm fine..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I swear I saw Miss Iris too just now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mmf, mrrmrmff!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A familiar voice can be heard from deep within a hay pile."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Geh... Quick, we gotta dig Iris out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "R-Right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Gasping for breath) I... I almost suffocated!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Weren't you two collecting children's wishes? What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hee-hee! It all went better than expected. The children here are surprisingly good, you know, so we wrapped up ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought I'd give driving in the countryside a shot, but then car trouble hit while I was at the wheel, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not my first time repairing vehicles like this one. Hurry, let's fix this one up together."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh* I can hardly tell if my luck is supposed to be good or rotten today..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I couldn't shake the worry something might happen, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I didn't expect our work to proceed so well today, and I certainly didn't expect this little mishap."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I only hope we can have this fixed soon... At least then we can be on our way back by tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tonight...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko turns to look behind her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not too far away, Sakiko's mother is watching her and her friends with a smile.\nShe notices her daughter's glance, and gives a light nod."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Would that be... your mother?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You very much resemble one another, especially the eyes and the mouth! I feel both a gentle warmth and a firm resolution in you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I... I have no resolve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What makes you say that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Iris, you're a fairy, if I'm not mistaken?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes... Is something wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fairies listen to people's wishes, and then temporarily make them 'reality' in their dreams... correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But if—if people are well and truly trapped in their dreams, never to pluck themselves out, what should be done then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A real fairy would never permit that to happen in the first place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you spend too long in a dream, you lose the ability to discern between dream and reality."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What if they never wake up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko, the worst outcome has never been the inability to wake up. Rather, it is when you accept everything in your dream as the truth, and <i>then</i> you wake, only to find that all you have experienced was a fleeting mirage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After living a lifetime of happiness in the dream, you find yourself back in reality, back at the very beginning again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your body is young, but your soul is old. Your dream is well beyond your grasp. You are left with no choice but to carry on in life, utterly alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can you really call that a good dream?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If it is doomed to fail, it should not be fled from in dreams; if they are destined to be missed, you must bid them farewell properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko looks back again."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, I appear to have gone on a little long... Am I interrupting your reunion with your mother?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...No, nothing of the sort!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I apologize. Someone very important to me asked me the same question, once upon a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Because of my inability to give a firm answer then, things turned irrecoverable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hence, I now lend such concern to this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heeey—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The car's all fixed up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Vigna, no more touching! No touching ever!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "C'mon, girls, get on—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Sakiko, will you be coming back with us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko turns once more to look at her 'mother'."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She's still standing there, as though she's awaiting something.\nIs she awaiting Sakiko's promise? Or perhaps Sakiko's verdict?\nShe simply stands there, looking on at her daughter with the warmest smile."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's okay, Sakiko. You can stay here a little longer. You've been worn out lately, yeah? You're due for a vacation anyway. I'll let HR know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay... Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me try again—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko, let's stop here for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aren't you tired? I'll make us some tea, then we can take our time—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm just nervous, that's all—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How about a little chat, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Were those girls just now friends of yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. They are my coworkers at Rhodes Island, and very good friends of mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Correct. A pharmaceutical company, boasting a landship of tremendous scale."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aboard the ship, we live and work, sailing anywhere and everywhere in the world."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The... 'world'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Terra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What an interesting word for it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does Rhodes Island have a piano room you can use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It does. There isn't too much entertainment while the ship is sailing. Many operators while away the time by playing instruments."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At times, I'll play a few songs on the keyboard in my dormitory room. Vigna has even formed her own band—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And have you formed your own band, too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that with Miss Vigna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No. It's with others..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, now I'm curious, Sakiko. What are these fellow band members of yours like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have a drummer who constantly clashes with me over just about everything, though her ambition and hardworking nature are second to none. We resemble sisters-in-arms more than we do friends."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have a bassist whose technique is superb. She handles all our behind-the-scenes work, schedules included, with great diligence. As a colleague, there could be no one more trustworthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have a guitarist-vocalist who excels at songwriting. She has her own work as an idol to take care of, but in spite of how busy it makes her, she never ceases to support me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I have another guitarist—we've been friends since childhood. She... she was always there for me, even when I left home and was all alone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By the sound of it, you're quite the close-knit band."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, the reality is we constantly argue. We even disbanded before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you all made up since?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I got separated from everyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They are somewhere far, far away. Somewhere I cannot reach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How far away? From Victoria to Ursus? Or even farther than that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why the hesitation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Because... Because..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Because I'm afraid that finding them means leaving you behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm scared I won't be able to see you again—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Silly girl. I'll always be here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But—didn't you leave me behind?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The warmth of her body... The realness of her breathing.\nSakiko's mother gazes warmly upon her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Sakiko... Mother lied to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You knew, didn't you? That I wasn't your real mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry. I've been so careful to keep this little white lie going."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wasn't there at your high school entrance ceremony. Before you asked me that question, my memory of you was still in middle school."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I don't know why it is, but when I see you smile these days, there are dark clouds hanging above you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko. When did you start making this kind of face?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just what suffering have you been through, in this stretch of time I know nothing about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry. I don't know anything about this. All I know is that during your hardest, most painful moments, I wasn't there for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko, I am so, so truly happy that I get to see you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I really, really want to see you grow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I want to stand right there in front of the stage and see your live shows."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I want to meet those new friends of yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm very greedy. I want to know everything about you, and be there by your side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But because I'm your mother... and because I love you so much..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want you to leave this place, and seek out your real life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go, Sakiko."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go back to your own 'world'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mother...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The emotion welling up in Sakiko's heart at last overflows. She buries her head in her mother's chest and bursts into tears.\nIn contrast, as she has always done, Sakiko's mother simply strokes her back and consoles her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Father'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? Sakiko, are you off again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko has something important to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Father'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, you just got home. Can't you stay a little longer...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dear..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Father'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Father'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko, your mother and I are on the same page!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Father'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Breaking up) Just... Just... remember to eat right while you're away from home!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right. I will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay... I'll be off now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother & Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sure!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother & Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have a safe journey, Sakiko—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
